  {# ---------------- WHAT IS LASER/ILCA RACING ---------------- #}
  <section class="section" id="what-is-laser-racing">
    <h2>What is ILCA/Laser racing?</h2>
    <p>
      The ILCA &mdash; long known as the Laser &mdash; is a one-design, single-handed
      sailing dinghy and one of the most popular racing boats in the world, sailed at every
      level from local club nights up to the Olympic Games. &ldquo;One-design&rdquo; means
      every boat is built to the same specification, so races are won by sailing skill and
      tactics rather than by who has the fastest equipment.
    </p>
