  {# ---------------- GOALS & MISSION ---------------- #}
  <section class="section" id="goals-mission">
    <h2>Goals &amp; mission</h2>
    <ol class="goals">
      <li>Promote life-long enjoyment of Corinthian ILCA/Laser racing.</li>
      <li>Advance the mean skill level and performance of the fleet.</li>
      <li>Recruit more sailors.</li>
      <li>Have even more fun.</li>
    </ol>
    <h3>Our mission</h3>
    <p>
      Our mission is to elevate ILCA/Laser racing in Buffalo and Western New York by
      organizing racing events, providing training opportunities, and ensuring access to
      the sport for all levels of sailors.
    </p>
  </section>

  {# ---------------- WHAT WE DO ---------------- #}
  <section class="section" id="what-we-do">
    <h2>What we do</h2>

    <h3>Monday Night Series</h3>
    <p>
      Our primary event is the Monday Night Series. Early and late in the season we organize
      a Race Committee, but during the heart of the season our racing happens in partnership
      with the Buffalo Small Boat Sailing League. Immediately following racing, sailors enjoy
      a social hour and BBQ weekly at Dale&rsquo;s Marina, provided by the Tanski Family.
    </p>

    <h3>Training &amp; development</h3>
    <p>
      We believe in the growth of every sailor. We offer training programs and clinics led by
      experienced members of the fleet and occasionally outside experts, with an emphasis on
      both on- and off-the-water training. The fleet facilitates a post-race recap at the
      Monday Night BBQ, and we encourage dialogue and insight sharing.
    </p>

    <h3>Camaraderie</h3>
    <p>
      Our fleet&rsquo;s success and cohesion are greatly supported by our off-the-water
      culture-building activities. From our weekly BBQ and race recap to other social events
      and parties, we emphasize that this should be social and fun. To build and sustain our
      fleet, we work to create a positive, inclusive, and friendly environment.
    </p>

    <h3>Access</h3>
    <p>
      Our fleet is welcoming &mdash; we want new sailors. We have boats to borrow, and we are
      here to support. We&rsquo;re happy to answer newcomers&rsquo; questions and stand ready
      to assist with a loaner boat or to help a new member select their first ILCA/Laser.
    </p>
  </section>

